  "schema:comment": "Apache-2.0 MCP adapter to a CLOSED hosted service (api.helena.bio); core variant-classification logic is not open. Clinical/high-risk. Submitted via MACH form (issue #6) by the maintainer. Re-verify hosting/licence on next review.",
